.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
.TH RCN 1 "September 2026" "rcn 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rcn \- ratio-first context-mixing compressor (goal: beat zstd \-19)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rcn
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.I COMMAND
...
.PP
.B rcn compress
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.I INPUT OUTPUT
.PP
.B rcn decompress
.I INPUT OUTPUT
.PP
.B rcn bench
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.I CORPUS
.PP
.B rcn self-test
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rcn
is a ratio-first context-mixing compressor. The success metric is beating
.B zstd \-19
on compressed size (ratio), not matching
.B zstd \-1
on throughput. It stages BWT, LZP, and online logistic mixing, then
entropy-codes with rANS into a .rcn (RCN1) container.
.PP
Invoke
.B rcn \-h
or
.B rcn \-\-help
for a summary; use
.B rcn
.I COMMAND
.B \-h
for per-command help.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B compress
Compress a file into a .rcn (RCN1) container.
.RS
.TP
.I INPUT
Path to the input file.
.TP
.I OUTPUT
Path for the compressed .rcn output.
.TP
.BI \-\-backend \ backend
Entropy backend. Only
.B rans
is built in (default:
.BR rans ).
.TP
.BI \-\-mode \ mode
Entropy mode:
.B slow
(bit-level CM, default; stronger on some binary) or
.B fast
(byte-level CM; usually better text ratio and speed; loses to zstd \-19 on mr).
Default stays
.B slow
until fast also beats or ties zstd \-19 on the full headline set.
.TP
.B \-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose
Print per-block kind, method, and sizes to stderr.
.RE
.TP
.B decompress
Decompress a .rcn (RCN1) container back to a file.
.RS
.TP
.I INPUT
Path to the .rcn container.
.TP
.I OUTPUT
Path for the restored output file.
.RE
.TP
.B bench
Benchmark rcn over every file in a corpus directory (timing and ratio).
.RS
.TP
.I CORPUS
Directory of files to compress.
.TP
.BI \-\-vs \ label
Reserved for SOTA comparison (see
.I scripts/bench_vs_sota.sh
in the source tree).
.TP
.B \-\-fast
Use the byte-level (fast) entropy mode.
.RE
.TP
.B self-test
Run the library test suite (via
.BR cargo )
and report PASS/FAIL.
.SH OPTIONS
Global options apply to every command:
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print help.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print version. Also accepted after a subcommand (for example
.BR "rcn compress \-V" ).
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
An error occurred (I/O failure, unsupported backend, compress/decompress
error such as CRC mismatch or corrupt container, or failing self-test).
.SH EXAMPLES
Compress a file:
.PP
.RS
.nf
rcn compress input.bin output.rcn
.fi
.RE
.PP
Compress with the fast entropy mode:
.PP
.RS
.nf
rcn compress input.bin output.rcn \-\-mode fast
.fi
.RE
.PP
Decompress:
.PP
.RS
.nf
rcn decompress output.rcn restored.bin
.fi
.RE
.PP
Bench a corpus directory:
.PP
.RS
.nf
rcn bench path/to/corpus
.fi
.RE
.PP
Show help or version:
.PP
.RS
.nf
rcn \-h
rcn \-\-version
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zstd (1),
.BR xz (1),
.BR gzip (1)
.PP
Project repository:
.IR https://github.com/rinchen/rcn
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at
.IR https://github.com/rinchen/rcn/issues .
